# =============================================================================
# Clang sanitizer special case list (see -fsanitize-blacklist)
# =============================================================================
# Consumed by Cmake/tools/sanitize.cmake (xsigma_configure_sanitizer) via
# configure_file whenever VECTORIZATION_ENABLE_SANITIZER=ON with Clang.
# Entries with no bracketed [tool] header apply to every sanitizer (ASan,
# UBSan, TSan, MSan, LSan).
#
# Vendored ThirdParty/ sources are excluded: Vectorization does not own their
# code, and instrumenting them only adds noise (and, for prebuilt/optimized
# paths, false positives) to reports scoped to this library.
src:*/ThirdParty/*
